%% Shadow mode (validation before automation): the shadow system runs on the same query, is logged, never shown.
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant S as SearchService
    participant R as Retrievers (shared runs)
    participant DB as SQLite

    U->>S: query
    S->>R: one BM25 run + one dense run
    R-->>S: candidate lists
    S->>S: shown ranking = DISPLAY_SYSTEM (B0 during validation)
    S->>S: shadow ranking = SHADOW_SYSTEM (S2 candidate)
    S->>DB: query_log (shown) + shadow_log (shown ids, shadow ids, overlap@k)
    S-->>U: only the shown ranking
    U->>S: feedback on shown passages (POST /v1/feedback)
    Note over DB: Offline: compare shown vs shadow on the same queries before switching DISPLAY_SYSTEM
